  "body": "<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\n\n- [ ] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chrome\n   * …\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * This is not tested directly, as the counter is not directly web-exposed. However, it enables the tests for a number of performance APIs:\n       * [performance-timeline/back-forward-cache-restoration.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/back-forward-cache-restoration.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n       * [performance-timeline/navigation-id-detached-frame.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/navigation-id-detached-frame.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n       * [performance-timeline/navigation-id-long-task-task-attribution.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/navigation-id-long-task-task-attribution.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n       * [performance-timeline/navigation-id-mark-measure.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/navigation-id-mark-measure.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n       * [performance-timeline/navigation-id-element-timing.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/navigation-id-element-timing.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n       * [performance-timeline/navigation-id-resource-timing.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/navigation-id-resource-timing.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n       * [performance-timeline/navigation-id-initial-load.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/navigation-id-initial-load.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n       * [performance-timeline/navigation-id-reset.tentative.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/performance-timeline/navigation-id-reset.tentative.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned)\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: [1273925](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1273925)\n   * Firefox: [1809226](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1809226)\n   * Safari: [250331](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=250331)\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7370/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 25, 2021, 7:55 PM UTC (9dea981)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7370/08b4033...9dea981/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 25, 2021, 7:55 PM UTC (9dea981)\">diff</a> )\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7370/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 9, 2023, 7:40 PM UTC (9dea981)\">/browsin